          "Sonarr.Common|M:NzbDrone.Common.Extensions.PathExtensions.PathEquals(System.String,System.String,System.Nullable{System.StringComparison})"
        ],
        "id": "R5",
        "text": "The update fails if the application's startup folder is the same as, or a parent of, the app data folder, because configuration would be lost during the upgrade."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Update.InstallUpdateService.InstallUpdate(NzbDrone.Core.Update.UpdatePackage)",
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Update.UpdateFolderNotWritableException.#ctor(System.String,System.Object[])"
