        "id": "R6",
        "text": "Unless the update mechanism is Script, both the startup folder and its UI subfolder must be writable, otherwise the update fails."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Update.InstallUpdateService.InstallUpdate(NzbDrone.Core.Update.UpdatePackage)"
        ],
        "id": "R7",
        "text": "When the startup folder ends with '_output' (developer environment), no update is performed."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
