        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Update.InstallUpdateService.InstallUpdate(NzbDrone.Core.Update.UpdatePackage)"
        ],
        "id": "R12",
        "text": "With the built-in mechanism, if the update client executable does not exist after preparing the client, the update is aborted with a warning."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Update.InstallUpdateService.InstallUpdate(NzbDrone.Core.Update.UpdatePackage)"
        ],
        "id": "R13",
